      "sourceRef": "public/index.html#status; GUIDE.md#Browser"
    },
    {
      "categoryId": "Q10",
      "applicability": "applicable",
      "reason": "现有任务包含刷新后的笔记读回；没有新增深链或未保存退出承诺",
      "sourceRef": "GUIDE.md#Browser; docs/feature-map.json#AC-0001"
    },
    {
      "categoryId": "Q11",
      "applicability": "applicable",
      "reason": "真实保存和搜索请求有异步状态，实际延迟网络核对正在保存反馈；乱序和防重未被此要求覆盖",
      "sourceRef": "public/index.html#script"
    },
    {
      "categoryId": "Q12",
